  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i> </p><p>Designed to help <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Squib\" title=\"Squib\">Squib</a> salvagers penetrate the inner parts of derelict Starships, the Squib Battering Ram allows the wielders to punch through doors with greater efficiency. </p><p>A Battering Ram requires two characters to operate (one to stabilize the Squib Battering Ram, and one to trigger its activation). The weapon is too unwieldy to be used against a living, moving target, but it deals normal damage to stationary, unattended objects (such as walls or doors). </p><p>A Battering Ram requires four <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Packs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Packs\">Power Packs</a> to operate. </p>",
